WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.734
The White House warning

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:01.768
China against, quote,

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:03.870
growing aggressiveness by its military

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:04.704
after this.

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:05.739
You're looking here on your screen.

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:06.539
This is a near collision

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:07.440
between an American

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.408
and a Chinese warships.

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:09.442
And this actually occurred

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:10.143
in the Chinese Strait.

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:11.411
Think about the Taiwan Strait.

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:13.580
I mean, look at how close they are

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:16.282
It won't be long

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:18.284
before somebody gets hurt.

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:18.785
That's the

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:19.652
that's the concern

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:20.487
with these unsafe

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:22.455
and unprofessional intercepts.

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:23.957
They can lead to misunderstandings

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:26.960
they can lead to miscalculations.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:28.762
This comes as top officials

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:29.829
from the US State Department

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.398
and the NSC are in Beijing,

00:00:31.398 --> 00:00:31.831
where they had

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:33.600
a, quote, candid and direct discussion

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.402
with their Chinese counterparts today

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:37.404
amid these increasing tensions

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:39.973
Will Ripley is OUTFRONT

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:43.343
on the streets, in the skies

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:44.411
and on the sea.

00:00:44.411 --> 00:00:45.945
Rising rhetoric and the U.S.

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:47.380
warns real danger

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.149
of military confrontation.

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:50.316
A growing list of U.S.

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:51.451
China flare ups

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:52.652
fueling fierce

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:54.220
anti-American sentiment

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.089
among the Chinese public.

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:57.323
Chinese state media

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:59.092
adding fuel to the fire,

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:01.294
blasting the airwaves with outrage.

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:03.530
Public perception of the U.S. plummeting.

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:05.765
A recent Chinese poll reveals

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:07.600
more than half of those surveyed

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.135
had a very unfavorable

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:11.104
or somewhat unfavorable impression

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:12.472
of the U.S..

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:14.040
Alternately, why, while the U.S.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:15.241
keeps picking on China,

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:16.876
says this man in Beijing.

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:18.978
It feels like the US is bullying China.

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:21.081
Those are a little edgy.

00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:23.316
Another making his views clear,

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:24.417
I don't like the U.S..

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:25.652
All bad things in the world

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:27.587
are caused by the U.S..

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:27.954
U.S.

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:28.755
polls show

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:29.522
many Americans

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:31.491
have similar views about China,

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:33.259
even in polarized Washington.

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:35.128
Countering Beijing has rare

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:36.863
bipartisan support

00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:37.564
from the Taiwan

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:38.431
Strait to the South

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:40.133
China Sea to Singapore.

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:40.567
The U.S.

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:42.168
and China seem to be spiraling

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.636
closer to conflict.

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:44.370
On Saturday,

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.473
a near collision on the Taiwan Strait,

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:47.273
the U.S.

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:48.608
accused a Chinese warship

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:50.777
of cutting off a U.S. Navy destroyer.

00:01:51.077 --> 00:01:51.511
The U.S.

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:54.647
says both ships came within 150 yards,

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:56.816
less than 500 feet of each other.

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:57.183
The U.S.

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:58.952
destroyer took emergency measures

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:01.621
to avoid a collision, a close encounter.

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:01.921
U.S.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:03.423
Defense Secretary Lloyd Austin

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:05.558
called extremely dangerous.

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:08.061
I'm concerned about at some point

00:02:08.061 --> 00:02:08.928
having an incident

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:10.630
that could very very quickly spiral

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:11.531
out of control.

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:13.533
Austin speaking at this Asian Defense

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:14.934
Summit in Singapore.

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:16.803
The Pentagon says China rejected

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:17.704
a proposed meeting

00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:19.239
with its defense minister, Nishank,

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:21.141
who their only interaction,

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:22.709
this brief handshake.

00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:23.143
The U.S.

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:24.144
says they did not have

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:25.812
a substantive exchange.

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:26.546
What a woman

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:28.014
generally had plenty to say

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:29.616
after the near collision.

00:02:29.616 --> 00:02:30.517
Blasting U.S.

00:02:30.517 --> 00:02:32.252
claims of a peaceful passage

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:33.653
through the Taiwan Strait

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:35.522
with a Canadian warship.

00:02:35.522 --> 00:02:37.323
They are not here for peaceful passage,

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:39.559
he says. They are here for provocation.

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:41.728
Tensions are already high,

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:43.263
getting even higher

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:44.364
just days earlier

00:02:44.364 --> 00:02:45.665
over the South China Sea.

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:47.967
A mid-air incident caught on camera.

00:02:48.134 --> 00:02:49.769
A Chinese jet danger

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:50.937
as they close to a U.S.

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:52.338
reconnaissance plane.

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:52.805
The U.S.

00:02:52.805 --> 00:02:53.506
calls this

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:55.975
an unnecessarily aggressive maneuver.

00:02:56.276 --> 00:02:57.377
China says it was just

00:02:57.377 --> 00:02:59.012
safeguarding its sovereignty,

00:02:59.012 --> 00:02:59.879
accusing the U.S.

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:02.382
military plane of deliberately intruding

00:03:02.382 --> 00:03:03.816
into China's training area.

00:03:05.018 --> 00:03:06.019
The government spokesperson

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:07.220
saying the U.S.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:08.021
should immediately

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:09.289
stop such dangerous

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:11.157
and provocative actions.

00:03:11.157 --> 00:03:12.325
Washington rejects

00:03:12.325 --> 00:03:14.327
Beijing's territorial claims over

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:16.462
nearly all the South China Sea,

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:16.930
saying

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:18.932
the United States will continue to fly

00:03:18.932 --> 00:03:20.733
sail and operate safely

00:03:20.733 --> 00:03:21.768
and responsibly

00:03:21.768 --> 00:03:23.870
wherever international law allows.

00:03:24.237 --> 00:03:25.805
Tensions rising ever since

00:03:25.805 --> 00:03:27.740
a controversial Taiwan trip

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:28.608
by former U.S.

00:03:28.608 --> 00:03:29.142
House Speaker

00:03:29.142 --> 00:03:31.110
Nancy Pelosi last year

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:33.046
and this year's meeting in California

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:33.846
between House Speaker

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:34.847
Kevin McCarthy

00:03:34.847 --> 00:03:37.317
and saying when president of Taiwan.

00:03:37.684 --> 00:03:38.851
China also claimed

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:39.485
sovereignty over

00:03:39.485 --> 00:03:40.954
the self-governing democracy

00:03:40.954 --> 00:03:41.721
its communist

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:43.690
rulers have never controlled.

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:45.858
Launching two rounds of massive

00:03:45.858 --> 00:03:48.027
military drills near Taiwan,

00:03:48.027 --> 00:03:49.229
only adding to U.S.

00:03:49.229 --> 00:03:49.963
concerns

00:03:49.963 --> 00:03:52.665
of a potential military miscalculation

00:03:52.932 --> 00:03:56.836
with massive consequences

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:57.270
I mean.

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.605
Well, it's amazing to see that.

00:03:58.605 --> 00:03:59.372
I mean, just to

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:00.974
think about 450 feet apart

00:04:00.974 --> 00:04:02.175
and the speed with that way

00:04:02.175 --> 00:04:03.243
that those ships were moving,

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:04.210
I mean, you just think about

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:05.778
what could have happened.

00:04:05.778 --> 00:04:07.347
The White House I know, says top U.S.

00:04:07.347 --> 00:04:08.681
officials brought up this near

00:04:08.681 --> 00:04:09.849
collision during their meeting

00:04:09.849 --> 00:04:11.951
with Beijing in Beijing today. I'm sorry.

00:04:12.352 --> 00:04:13.920
What are the Chinese

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:14.887
officials saying about it?

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:18.725
Publicly, not much other

00:04:18.725 --> 00:04:20.193
than calling on the United States

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:21.261
to stop what they call

00:04:21.261 --> 00:04:22.695
provocative behavior, Aaron.

00:04:22.695 --> 00:04:23.096
But look,

00:04:23.096 --> 00:04:24.330
just the fact that there are talks

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.531
happening in Beijing

00:04:25.531 --> 00:04:26.599
is an encouraging sign,

00:04:26.599 --> 00:04:27.767
because for months the U.S.

00:04:27.767 --> 00:04:29.402
has been trying to rekindle

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:30.570
high level diplomacy.

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:31.237
Remember, there was a

00:04:31.237 --> 00:04:32.071
thaw when

00:04:32.071 --> 00:04:33.506
President Biden and President

00:04:33.506 --> 00:04:35.174
Xi met in Bali last November,

00:04:35.174 --> 00:04:36.676
but then the suspected Chinese spy

00:04:36.676 --> 00:04:38.511
balloon on the eve of

00:04:38.511 --> 00:04:38.811
you know,

00:04:38.811 --> 00:04:39.646
it was supposed to be

00:04:39.646 --> 00:04:41.581
a very important diplomatic visit

00:04:41.581 --> 00:04:43.883
by the secretary of state to Beijing

00:04:43.983 --> 00:04:45.351
that derailed the whole thing.

00:04:45.351 --> 00:04:46.352
And basically,

00:04:46.352 --> 00:04:47.387
both sides haven't been able

00:04:47.387 --> 00:04:48.488
to communicate

00:04:48.488 --> 00:04:49.722
at a high level ever since.

00:04:49.722 --> 00:04:50.523
So if indeed

00:04:50.523 --> 00:04:51.357
now there are these lower

00:04:51.357 --> 00:04:52.325
level discussions,

00:04:52.325 --> 00:04:53.593
perhaps that could lead

00:04:53.593 --> 00:04:54.594
to higher level meetings,

00:04:54.594 --> 00:04:56.696
which could try to potentially put

00:04:57.263 --> 00:04:58.498
some sort of a pause

00:04:58.498 --> 00:05:00.033
in this escalating tension

00:05:00.033 --> 00:05:01.134
that really has been going

00:05:01.134 --> 00:05:01.467
you know,

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:02.335
whether it's Taiwan,

00:05:02.335 --> 00:05:03.369
the South China Sea,

00:05:03.369 --> 00:05:04.470
China's deepening partnership

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.239
with Russia, There's a lot that the U.S.

00:05:06.239 --> 00:05:07.273
and China need to talk about

00:05:07.273 --> 00:05:09.242
to avoid a misunderstanding Erin.

00:05:09.242 --> 00:05:09.542
All right.

00:05:09.542 --> 00:05:10.977
Well, thank you very much from

00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:11.911
Taipei tonight.

